kind":"source_review","person_id":"jqx_hf5_1y6","source_quote":"　　又同郡樓惠明，有道術。居金華山，禽獸毒螫者皆避之。宋明帝聞之，勑出住華林園，除奉朝請，固乞不受，求東歸。永明三年，忽乘輕舟向臨安縣，衆不知所以。尋而唐宇之賊破郡。文惠太子呼出住蔣山，又求歸，見許。世祖敕爲立館。","reading":"樓惠明拒宋明帝所授，永明三年避賊，末有太子與世祖所命。","note":"樓惠明拒宋明帝所授，永明三年避賊，末有太子與世祖所命。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p081","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":107,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p081:m0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"樓惠明","kind":"person","person_id":"jqx_hf5_1y6","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p081","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p081","text":"　　又同郡樓惠明，有道術。居金華山，禽獸毒螫者皆避之。宋明帝聞之，勑出住華林園，除奉朝請，固乞不受，求東歸。永明三年，忽乘輕舟向臨安縣，衆不知所以。尋而唐宇之賊破郡。文惠太子呼出住蔣山，又求歸，見許。世祖敕爲立館。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":204,"last_line":204,"raw_start":10548,"raw_end":10655,"raw_character_offsets":[10548,10549,10550,10551,10552,10553,10554,10555,10556,10557,10558,10559,10560,10561,10562,10563,10564,10565,10566,10567,10568,10569,10570,10571,10572,10573,10574,10575,10576,10577,10578,10579,10580,10581,10582,10583,10584,10585,10586,10587,10588,10589,10590,10591,10592,10593,10594,10595,10596,10597,10598,10599,10600,10601,10602,10603,10604,10605,10606,10607,10608,10609,10610,10611,10612,10613,10614,10615,10616,10617